Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,ПРЕДСТ,,0,0,0,,ФАНСАБ-ГРУППА АЗАЛИИ ПРЕДСТАВЛЯЕТ
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\c&HFFFFFF&\fade(00,0)\p1\a5\bord0\1a&H00&\pos(430,206)\fscx807\fscy277}m 0 0 l 0 0 l 92 0 l 92 38 l 0 38
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,worked,,0,0,0,,{\pos(801,256)}Worked on the series:\N Lily, Tiramisu, Biryulka, Host, Pineapple
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,title,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(846,392)}How I became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:03.98,name,,0,0,0,,{\fscx75\fscy75\pos(848,456)}queen
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.06,2:01:37.06,PRESENT,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\pos(1181,4)}AZALEA
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.16,0:01:06.43,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,All characters are fictitious,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.43,0:01:08.53,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,and the events shown are fiction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:11.76,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,So it was you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.66,0:02:14.33,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,You were that person.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.94,0:02:24.51,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I won’t forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:47.40,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.72,0:03:45.69,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,12 episode: Dance on the edge of the sword
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.90,0:03:52.84,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:56.71,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Now I understand who’s boss in the palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.55,0:04:07.02,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I almost shot you. \NMistaken for prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.19,0:04:09.29,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Or maybe she missed by mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.29,0:04:11.46,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,It's just a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.64,0:04:21.47,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Remember your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.58,0:04:30.68,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I have to change clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.68,0:04:31.75,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Yes, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.37,0:04:56.37,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,There is a case for the Detective Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.29,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Was it necessary to do this with Ovol?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.46,0:05:14.82,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,What did I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.22,0:05:17.36,Default,Spillie1,0,0,0,,Was it necessary to kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.66,0:05:20.26,Default,Spiky1,0,0,0,,And then throw the dead one into the well?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.63,0:05:25.43,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Did you have to do this to an innocent girl just to intimidate me?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.64,0:05:26.77,Default,Spillie1,0,0,0,,Did I kill her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.97,0:05:28.91,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Where does this misconception come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.04,0:05:30.51,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I am generally against killing all living things,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.51,0:05:32.48,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,unless for cooking.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.21,0:05:37.91,Default,Spiky1,0,0,0,,The fact that her body was found in the well is either a terrible coincidence,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.38,0:05:40.52,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,or someone wants to push us over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.75,0:05:45.62,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Deny further until my rage reaches its limit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.92,0:05:49.13,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,You're driving me crazy. \NI definitely didn't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.13,0:05:51.46,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Where does this bad opinion of me come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.66,0:05:52.93,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Because that’s who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.23,0:05:56.83,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Kim Soyeon, whom I know, is just capable of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.37,0:05:59.20,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,How do you know me if I don’t know myself yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.34,0:06:03.44,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,The best liar lies to himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.77,0:06:06.51,Default,Silk1,0,0,0,,You are deceiving yourself by saying that you don’t know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.01,0:06:15.42,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,I think we have now passed the point of no return.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.42,0:06:19.16,Default,Silk1,0,0,0,,I will not pay attention\N to your misconceptions about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.12,0:06:21.46,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.73,0:06:30.77,Default,Spillit1,0,0,0,,Rabbit
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.95,0:06:45.15,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Who shot her?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.15,0:06:47.38,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,We chased her so much, so who dared...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.42,0:06:58.39,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Looks like we have a winner. It's time to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.83,0:07:00.13,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,-Yes, queen.\N-Yes, queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.41,0:07:16.68,Default,Spillie1,0,0,0,,This is blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.15,0:07:20.52,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,That’s rubbish.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.68,0:07:23.75,Default,Spillie1,0,0,0,,Are you completely crazy? It's incredibly painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.32,0:07:27.12,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Sorry, my hand slipped.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.66,0:07:29.96,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,-That little one...\N-Are you okay, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.96,0:07:32.33,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Even with a soft tip, it still hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.70,0:07:34.83,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Your Highness, what are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.44,0:07:43.14,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,I will repay you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.27,0:07:46.01,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,You're dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.71,0:07:52.75,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.08,0:07:57.62,Default,Spiky1,0,0,0,,For the sake of my dear husband, I will let her go today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.59,0:08:00.56,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,-Because I’m in charge here.\N-Of course, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.40,0:08:09.97,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Go to the Hidzhonjon hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.43,0:08:12.07,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,I'll help you change clothes...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.07,0:08:14.17,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Someone is trying to disrupt the feast,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.14,0:08:16.81,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,so I'll go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.57,0:08:54.11,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Everyone who is invited here today,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.11,0:08:56.58,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,will perceive the king \Nas vested with power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.01,0:08:58.91,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,And everything that was said about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:00.68,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,even the nickname of the woodcutter prince from Ganghwado,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.78,0:09:03.09,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,will turn into false rumors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.45,0:09:07.09,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,The king insisted on a feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.09,0:09:08.46,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Must have chosen this day,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.46,0:09:10.79,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,to appear before the court in a new guise.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.16,0:09:13.83,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,How did you manage to blink
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.40,0:09:17.93,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,his preparation?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.20,0:09:21.54,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.27,0:09:23.27,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,However
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.91,0:09:27.21,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I also have something prepared for the king,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:30.08,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,so watch carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.55,0:09:35.28,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,I hope you prepared as you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.69,0:09:45.33,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Concubine Hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.06,0:09:47.20,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,One point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.76,0:09:51.53,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Royal Concubine Cho. 2 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.17,0:09:54.77,Default,Spillie1,0,0,0,,Concubine Min.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.37,0:09:57.67,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,4 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.57,0:10:02.11,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Concubine Yun. She also has 4 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.61,0:10:06.18,Default,Spillit1,0,0,0,,Queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.25,0:10:10.32,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,10 points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.19,0:10:12.22,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.03,0:10:19.20,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,In the end, the queen won.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.46,0:10:22.26,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,The Queen Mother will present the award.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.98,0:10:36.71,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,She said that you would just enjoy the holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.85,0:10:38.75,Default,Silk1,0,0,0,,Practiced secretly?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.91,0:10:41.22,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Like a born actor,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.75,0:10:44.99,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,I'm better at real games.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.49,0:10:51.03,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.03,0:10:53.66,Default,Silk1,0,0,0,,-Congratulations, Your Majesty.\N-Congratulations, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.90,0:11:00.20,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,What treachery.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.10,0:11:04.07,Default,Silk1,0,0,0,,We must proceed to the palace for the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.41,0:11:06.58,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,But we have a little time before the start,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.58,0:11:09.08,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,so you can rest for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.08,0:11:11.11,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I'm sure you're tired after the hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.48,0:11:13.72,Default,Silk1,0,0,0,,-Yes, the queen mother.\N-Yes, the queen mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.46,0:11:22.76,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Very painful?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.06,0:11:25.13,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.13,0:11:28.60,Default,Silk1,0,0,0,,Now I understand why eunuch Kim was so afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.16,0:11:31.17,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, you need to return to the Daejojeon Hall
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.17,0:11:33.17,Default,Silk1,0,0,0,,and dress appropriately for the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.17,0:11:35.24,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Exactly. And I'll take a break while I'm there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.24,0:11:38.27,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,-Of course.\N-The back of my head still hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.27,0:11:39.38,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,That’s bad luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.98,0:11:49.22,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Let's hurry. There is very little time before the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.89,0:12:00.76,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Why did she do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:04.60,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,I'm sure someone is trying to push us over.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.33,0:12:06.40,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.55,0:12:09.84,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Who knew that the situation with the well would ruin the relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.77,0:12:14.68,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,There are always three problems in the palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.41,0:12:16.91,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Hidden enmity of women,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.41,0:12:20.22,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,power struggle among the court and
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.95,0:12:22.99,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,death from poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.29,0:12:28.79,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,So that’s why you keep mentioning poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.89,0:12:30.96,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I lived in a palace for decades
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.26,0:12:34.23,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,and saw many who died from various poisons.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:38.40,Default,Spill1,0,0,0,,Deadly poison kills with one drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.83,0:12:40.10,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Hidden poisons
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.10,0:12:42.14,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,kill slowly under the guise of illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.67,0:12:44.57,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,And although they were not found,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.04,0:12:47.74,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,but I’m sure many deaths
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.74,0:12:49.48,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,were due to poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.21,0:12:53.55,Default,Biryulka1,0,0,0,,Yes, the palace is a very dangerous place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:12:58.82,Default,Silk1,0,0,0,,If you think about it, that person who looks like Khan...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.06,0:13:04.26,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Here he is. That guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.39,0:13:05.43,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Hide.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.00,0:13:09.90,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,And then she turned around...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.07,0:13:12.90,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Did she see my face? Don't think.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.90,0:13:14.34,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,That's why I ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.67,0:13:16.27,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,-Are you sure?\N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.27,0:13:18.67,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.81,0:13:25.81,Default,Spillit1,0,0,0,,Court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.02,0:13:27.95,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Go and find out who the person who
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.95,0:13:28.98,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,just spoke here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.29,0:13:32.25,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,I bet my lost dragon balls,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.25,0:13:34.56,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,that his last name is Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.32,0:13:37.79,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,The feast will begin soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.83,0:13:39.13,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Will not start,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.13,0:13:40.80,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,while this guy is snooping around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.16,0:13:42.23,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:45.03,Default,Silk1,0,0,0,,Then what about the royal cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.73,0:13:46.77,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,What a scoundrel.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.94,0:13:53.41,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Why does everything look like what I went through?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.88,0:13:57.28,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,And Cheoljong has no idea what’s going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.65,0:14:03.29,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,In order not to regret anything, people must live in accordance with their status.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.59,0:14:05.85,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,But I’ll be myself and won’t bother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:11.73,Default,Spilligu1,0,0,0,,I’m sure he mixed something in the water.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.60,0:14:14.90,Default,Spillie1,0,0,0,,Poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.20,0:14:18.97,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.20,0:14:20.97,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,Even if the palace is a cruel place,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.97,0:14:23.61,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,why would he ruin the feast with mass poisoning?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.21,0:14:25.27,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Definitely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.11,0:14:30.78,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Anxiety and fear are contagious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.78,0:14:32.28,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Holy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.55,0:14:33.68,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.15,0:14:36.49,Default,Spilyk1,0,0,0,,To the crime scene for evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.59,0:14:38.12,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Well, you will come to Daejojon.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.15,0:14:40.92,Default,Spikyulka1,0,0,0,,My mind is racing back and forth, and my sense of direction is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.02,0:14:43.59,Default,Spillik1,0,0,0,,Wait for me, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.55,0:15:09.55,Default,it's 2,0,0,0 of you,,It seems to smell like some kind of grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.65,0:15:12.25,Default,it's 2,0,0,0,,What did he add?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.96,0:15:14.12,Default,it's 2,0,0,0 of you,,And forget to think!
