Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.55,0:19:05.85,Default,it's 2,0,0,0,,Hello!\NLong time no see!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.85,0:19:07.62,Default,there are 2 of you,0,0,0,,I caught a cold here,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.49,0:19:10.76,Default,it's 2,0,0,0,,lend you! Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.35,0:19:33.82,Default,it's 2,0,0,0,,Fig! Rice! This is rice!
