Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.30,0:21:00.67,Default,it’s 2,0,0,0 of you,,Why are there so many temptations today?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.50,0:21:05.24,Default,you are 2,0,0,0,,Forget about it,\Nyou are a court lady, control yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:25.29,Default,there are 2 of you,0,0,0,,Court lady,\Ndo you want to tell me something?
