Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.38,0:27:00.11,Default,it is 2,0,0,0 of you,,Stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.85,0:27:02.92,Default,it's 2,0,0,0 of you,,My tummy, my tummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.92,0:27:05.35,Default,you are 2,0,0,0,,You have all been poisoned with some herbs.
