Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.38,0:29:18.88,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,This is a persimmon that lives only a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.88,0:29:20.66,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Which outback are you from, brat?
