Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.20,0:29:30.03,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,-Really?\N-Of course, brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.03,0:29:32.13,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Hey, this is out of place.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.13,0:29:34.03,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,You abandoned the kitchen and ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.03,0:29:35.10,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,What kind of cook are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.10,0:29:36.28,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.28,0:29:38.30,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,I went to Nanonpo to find food
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.30,0:29:39.71,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,to relieve abdominal pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.61,0:29:41.64,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Nenonpho?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.64,0:29:43.78,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Yes, to the royal farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.78,0:29:44.95,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,You know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.46,0:29:49.92,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Show me what you brought.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.09,0:29:58.70,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Preparing a dish begins with the selection\N of high-quality products.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.59,0:30:02.74,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,And on the royal farm
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.74,0:30:04.74,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,do they raise chickens too?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.91,0:30:08.48,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,If you bring some eggs, I can cook something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.02,0:30:25.05,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Your stomach is already growling.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.05,0:30:27.32,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,You haven’t eaten since yesterday in order to break away today.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.32,0:30:29.39,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Since you understand this,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.39,0:30:31.36,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,which means I haven’t eaten anything since yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.21,0:30:40.78,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,The feast that you asked to hold,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.78,0:30:42.71,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,will start soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.64,0:30:46.18,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.41,0:31:13.67,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Each banquet in the Blue House was themed,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.48,0:31:17.21,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,because this is politics, not just food.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.30,0:31:20.87,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,What to cook?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.11,0:31:23.92,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,What is the purpose of this banquet?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.96,0:31:28.99,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.35,0:31:31.35,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,The menu was made by the king himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.35,0:31:33.96,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,And this is the complete list of guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.39,0:31:38.79,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,So everyone was talking about this “riser” menu?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.20,0:31:44.36,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,I’ll create a new menu from these products.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.42,0:32:01.61,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,How did it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.52,0:32:03.69,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.69,0:32:07.70,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,I spoke with the robbers, but they weren’t the ones hunting for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.39,0:32:48.94,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Finally, the feast begins.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.92,0:33:03.48,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,This is a royal feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.92,0:33:06.69,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Only one dish will be served?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.11,0:33:09.28,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,This cannot be called a royal meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.55,0:33:11.16,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Can’t be. This is all?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.28,0:33:13.46,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,I’m sure there will be more dishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.46,0:33:16.82,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, can you explain?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.09,0:33:19.47,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,People suffer from hunger every year.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.77,0:33:22.06,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Some even die.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.03,0:33:25.27,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,To remind of their suffering,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.80,0:33:28.60,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,they have prepared a modest meal for you for the commoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.63,0:33:31.14,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,With all due respect,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.14,0:33:33.84,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,the word “modest” does not fit here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.11,0:33:36.84,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,You wanted to inform the officials,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.95,0:33:39.34,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,but this cannot be served to the nobles,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.34,0:33:41.35,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,who came to the feast from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.35,0:33:42.49,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.72,0:33:45.08,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Serve this dish to invited guests
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.62,0:33:47.19,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,akin to punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.03,0:33:51.47,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Perhaps you were expecting different food, but I hope
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.73,0:33:54.33,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,you will understand what I wanted to show.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.37,0:34:08.95,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,30 minutes before
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.24,0:34:12.68,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Let's pierce it with a needle like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.72,0:34:15.08,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,What kind of scribbles are these?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.62,0:34:17.79,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Throw the potatoes. I'll show you how to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.01,0:34:51.35,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Finally, the needle came in handy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.39,0:34:56.10,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Heat the oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.66,0:34:59.70,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Oil?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.26,0:35:07.87,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,How dare you fry my needle?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.97,0:35:10.01,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Calm down. I'll sterilize her.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.41,0:35:11.74,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Do you even know what it means?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.04,0:35:14.87,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,50 years ago my mentor gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.12,0:35:16.35,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.35,0:35:18.99,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,50 years? Well, that's it, her deadline is up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.31,0:35:20.81,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,No! I need her!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.81,0:35:22.49,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,I will pass it on to my student!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.76,0:35:23.91,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Don’t you dare put her down!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.89,0:35:32.93,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.06,0:35:42.68,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Looks beautiful and harmonious with a needle in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.68,0:35:46.14,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,In this way, even the core will quickly cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.85,0:35:51.79,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,How did you come up with such a great idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.79,0:35:53.89,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Speed ​​is important in cooking street food.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.06,0:35:56.12,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Ideal for such an urgent situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.01,0:35:58.03,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Street?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.45,0:36:00.85,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,It looks like a war zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.49,0:36:03.62,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,She survived the fierce battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.33,0:36:09.37,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.43,0:36:12.64,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Peel the potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.76,0:36:13.93,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.58,0:36:15.91,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Who else?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.64,0:36:20.97,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Need rice candies?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.97,0:36:25.14,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,I was sent to check how things are going.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.06,0:36:45.47,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.41,0:36:49.83,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Slice as thin as possible. Even thinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.83,0:36:50.97,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.04,0:36:53.10,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,The tip is sharper. Even sharper.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.14,0:36:54.72,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,We will pierce potatoes with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.97,0:36:56.68,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.72,0:36:59.41,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,-The flame is too big.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.81,0:37:02.99,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,-And here you need to be stronger.\N-Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.01,0:37:06.72,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Excellent. Remember everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.60,0:37:10.45,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,We are not just preparing food today.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.43,0:37:13.79,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,This is the face of the president.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.41,0:37:24.54,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,That is, the face of His Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.08,0:37:35.76,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Is that okay, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.26,0:37:37.93,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,That is, the cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.16,0:37:40.33,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.43,0:37:44.56,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.70,0:37:52.91,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,I hope Cheoljong will understand the underlying idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.01,0:38:11.35,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Is this the humble food of ordinary people?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.35,0:38:14.76,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Only I don’t know what ordinary people eat?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.66,0:38:19.76,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Spiral Potatoes
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.08,0:38:29.74,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,My intention was noble,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.37,0:38:34.04,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,however, I must respect my guests.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.45,0:38:36.95,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Therefore simple products were used,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.24,0:38:39.35,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,but they are prepared in a new way.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.64,0:38:44.95,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,The first dish of the feast is potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.83,0:38:47.06,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Are these potatoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:49.79,0:38:51.12,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,These are not ordinary potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.83,0:38:52.97,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,The dish is called...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.99,0:38:57.29,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Writhes
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.70,0:38:59.76,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,like a spring?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.87,0:39:04.04,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Spiral Potatoes!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.54,0:39:05.58,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.58,0:39:07.81,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Resembles a dragon's mustache.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.81,0:39:09.24,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,It’s called “Spiral”.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.74,0:39:12.64,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Happy dish for a happy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.64,0:39:14.35,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,It's just a potato.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.35,0:39:17.16,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Dragon? You're exaggerating, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.56,0:39:19.22,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,If there were no potatoes,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.22,0:39:21.45,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,we would lose more lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.26,0:39:23.76,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Village potatoes
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.76,0:39:26.39,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,grows even in barren soil and is easily stored.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.60,0:39:29.20,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,This is the main food product during barley growing.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.76,0:39:33.43,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Sacred product that saves lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.81,0:39:36.01,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,It's not "just a potato."
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.64,0:39:38.74,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Taste the dish.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.35,0:40:00.03,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Crazy. Very tasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.60,0:40:02.26,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,I’ve never eaten anything like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:03.70,0:40:07.54,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,The right adviser seems to be completely hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.47,0:40:17.74,Default,Kus3,0,0,0,,Are these potatoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.33,0:40:33.22,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,There are three seasonings in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.22,0:40:35.64,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Green is pine salt from the Namyang Khon family.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.06,0:40:38.81,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,It was prepared from sea salt and pine needles
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.81,0:40:40.20,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,in Hwaseong Palace.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.74,0:40:44.87,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Light red powder - grape sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.54,0:40:47.54,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Sugar? It would be better if they grew barley.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.24,0:40:50.37,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,With such delicious food there is nothing to worry about,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.37,0:40:52.41,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,all difficulties will be resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.12,0:40:57.16,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Crushed iris mixed with wild grapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.99,0:40:59.66,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Grapes were collected on Mount Kamaksan
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.66,0:41:01.66,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,on the territory of the Phapyeong family of Yun.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.66,0:41:03.72,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,It gives sugar a beautiful color and aroma.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.79,0:41:07.10,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Yellow sauce is made from peaches.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.62,0:41:09.70,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,The best peaches were selected
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.70,0:41:12.16,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,from Yoju, where the Yohyn clan of Min lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.04,0:41:16.83,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,The theme of today's feast is harmony.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.91,0:41:21.04,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Politics divides people,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.04,0:41:24.18,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,but delicious food unites them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.62,0:41:28.08,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I hope you can feel the harmony of the three clans,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.49,0:41:30.29,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,joined us today.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.47,0:41:43.47,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Chop and fry sweet potatoes, zucchini and eggplant.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.47,0:41:45.37,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I’ll make a vegetable stew in whole tomatoes
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.37,0:41:46.87,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,with broth and eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.51,0:41:49.64,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Such an unusual idea,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.64,0:41:52.20,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,how to eat the vessel itself will drive them crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.18,0:41:56.31,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Not finished yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.01,0:41:58.12,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Where there.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.12,0:42:00.68,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I ground the barley and beans into powder.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.68,0:42:03.56,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I have all possible types of powder, and I mix them and mix them.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.35,0:42:08.26,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,The dish you are preparing now will be the highlight of the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.26,0:42:09.26,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.99,0:42:14.47,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Knead more vigorously, like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.43,0:42:18.76,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,It is harmful to the joints of the shoulders and wrists.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.76,0:42:21.33,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Come on. Use more force. Do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.33,0:42:24.04,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Work with your shoulders and wrists if necessary.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.04,0:42:25.87,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Press the dough.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.18,0:42:31.51,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Teacher, everything is ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.51,0:42:32.51,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.58,0:42:35.89,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.35,0:42:38.72,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Whatever you say, this is a feast. No way without meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.22,0:42:41.08,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Completes our main course -
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.08,0:42:42.83,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,burger with vegan steak.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.37,0:43:05.12,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,McDonald's
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.12,0:43:06.72,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Edible tomato vessel.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.18,0:43:08.49,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Tomato red
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.49,0:43:10.95,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,on Cart Day drives away bad luck
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.95,0:43:12.89,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,and evil spirits.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.97,0:43:22.64,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,What a delicate taste!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.20,0:43:31.35,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Is this a meat cutlet?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.68,0:43:34.45,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Impossible. The meat could not be delivered...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.14,0:43:40.64,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I wanted to say that it’s hard to get meat now.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.85,0:43:44.49,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,There is one Chinese proverb:
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.49,0:43:46.22,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,"There is dragon meat in the sky,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.22,0:43:47.89,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,and on earth - from monkeys."
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.16,0:43:51.93,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,And we will add: “Meat from beans in hard times.”
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.56,0:43:56.64,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,With barley and beans we will grow a belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.99,0:43:59.81,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,This is the essence of McDonald's.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.26,0:44:01.93,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,McDonald's.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:02.74,0:44:04.14,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.14,0:44:08.14,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Nourishing and tasty, like real meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.87,0:44:10.14,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,There is something in this.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.78,0:44:44.85,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,How beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.24,0:44:48.49,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Decorate with flowers, and the cooled sweet jelly will be ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.49,0:44:49.79,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,A treat for the eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.31,0:44:53.03,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Desserts should be tasty and beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.43,0:44:56.95,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,-Amazing.\N-Just look at these colors.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.95,0:44:59.43,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,And finally, let’s make everyone say “wow.”
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.72,0:45:01.70,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Perfect end to the party.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:12.47,0:45:13.81,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Jelly of luck
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.81,0:45:15.24,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Beautiful, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.24,0:45:17.85,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,but it's just regular jelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.04,0:45:22.22,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I guess you didn’t have enough for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.39,0:45:26.93,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Thanks to the stick, eating jelly is much more convenient.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.39,0:45:29.12,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,And she will also predict your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.62,0:45:30.62,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Good luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:30.85,0:45:32.62,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,This dish is like a new beginning,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.62,0:45:35.83,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,that’s why it’s called good luck jelly.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.47,0:45:40.01,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I hope that your future will be successful, like a new beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.01,0:45:49.72,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Perhaps we’ll finish our feast by finding out our luck?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.31,0:45:54.14,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,How can we do something like this in a sacred palace?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.58,0:45:59.79,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Another one
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.18,0:46:02.29,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.29,0:46:03.35,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Another one?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.26,0:46:07.12,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,"Try next time."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.14,0:46:13.93,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Loser
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.92,0:46:21.22,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,How my back hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.52,0:46:26.03,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I'll lay back right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.90,0:46:32.97,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I put my soul into these dishes, not the ingredients.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.20,0:46:35.24,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I'm going to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.77,0:46:39.07,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.67,0:46:40.91,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,We were able to.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.91,0:46:45.78,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Do you know what I’m thinking about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.65,0:46:50.25,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I know. I feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.55,0:46:54.12,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,-Fish cutlets.\N-What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.69,0:46:56.32,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I'm thinking about fish cakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.69,0:47:01.09,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,The cook who almost died at the hands of Emperor Qin Shihuang,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.09,0:47:03.26,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,cooked fish cakes the night before.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.26,0:47:05.53,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I thought he was just lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:06.23,0:47:07.37,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,But no.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.57,0:47:08.60,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,He prepared them,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.60,0:47:10.64,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,trying my best to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.87,0:47:12.34,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Inspiration -
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.34,0:47:14.34,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,this is not something ordinary that comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.44,0:47:15.88,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,when you give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.18,0:47:18.31,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.35,0:47:20.41,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.28,0:47:24.79,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Well, why were you in such a hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.79,0:47:28.46,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Here. There's some water here. Have a drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.96,0:47:35.80,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Queen, his last name is Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:36.36,0:47:38.50,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Really? Is his last name really Khan?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.50,0:47:39.53,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.30,0:47:41.64,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,His name is Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.77,0:47:43.27,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,His name is Khan Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.30,0:47:45.81,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Simon? What is his name as a foreigner?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.68,0:47:50.88,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Khan Simon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.38,0:47:52.38,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.81,0:47:55.42,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.42,0:47:57.68,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Oh no. Nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.32,0:48:01.02,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,While I was outside the palace,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.02,0:48:02.89,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I reached Hanseongbu
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.89,0:48:05.16,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,and looked through their family register.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.39,0:48:10.23,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I'm sure this family register is fake.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.67,0:48:15.07,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I didn’t expect anything else from the ancestors of Director Khan.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.30,0:48:17.10,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,We expelled him for falsifying his identity,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.10,0:48:19.71,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,so he decided to win over him in such a dirty way?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.71,0:48:22.08,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Queen, you shouldn’t stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.18,0:48:24.04,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,You have been absent for a long time already.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.04,0:48:25.18,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.41,0:48:26.78,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,You did well, Lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.78,0:48:28.82,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,-Let's go quickly.\N-Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.82,0:48:30.48,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,-Wait.\N-Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.48,0:48:31.52,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.69,0:48:35.52,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.92,0:48:37.02,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.92,0:48:40.46,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,What? What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.63,0:48:45.23,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,My belly...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.87,0:48:49.54,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,It’s like a whole band is playing drums in my stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.30,0:48:51.51,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.01,0:48:54.07,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Water...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.91,0:48:57.48,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Nobody changed the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.48,0:48:59.85,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,What's wrong with this
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.91,0:49:02.05,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,water?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.32,0:49:04.42,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,This water has been poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.95,0:49:06.92,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:08.26,0:49:09.49,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.32,0:49:11.32,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Court lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.43,0:49:14.93,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,I see you have arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.03,0:49:17.40,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Of course, he came.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.63,0:49:22.10,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,This is a feast in honor of the queen’s recovery.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.40,0:49:24.24,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,From now on, keep your eyes open.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.87,0:49:27.81,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Watch the result of your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.82,0:49:42.02,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.09,0:49:46.13,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Cooking turned out to be harder than I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.53,0:49:50.33,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Every centimeter of my body hurts.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.10,0:49:55.67,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Also, the royal cook kept shouting at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.57,0:49:59.47,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,-This bastard.\N-Hurry here!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:02.71,0:50:04.44,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Do you still need to peel the potatoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:04.44,0:50:07.01,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Help the court lady Choi.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.05,0:50:08.18,Default,Kus4,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.59,0:50:21.83,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Keep up the good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.27,0:50:28.40,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.41,0:50:39.98,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Was wearing a tokkebi mask
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.81,0:50:42.88,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,and he has an old scar on his face.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.96,0:50:51.02,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.17,0:51:00.23,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,God.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.43,0:51:02.50,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.46,0:51:27.73,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Look, she is suffering from pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.13,0:51:30.70,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Do acupuncture, cauterize with grass, do something.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.70,0:51:32.73,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,And give her the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.73,0:51:35.30,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Hey, mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.44,0:51:37.27,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,I am in charge in this area.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.75,0:51:47.31,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,I obey.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.55,0:51:49.48,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,You were terrible in the royal kitchen,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:49.48,0:51:51.42,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,but in the royal hospital you are ideal.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.45,0:51:54.72,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Be it a person or an object,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.72,0:51:56.99,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,everyone should be in their place.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.86,0:52:01.33,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Your needle works better in the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.33,0:52:02.33,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,That’s not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.33,0:52:04.53,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,This needle is ideal for piercing potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:04.53,0:52:05.63,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Let me use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:05.77,0:52:07.20,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,How dare you plan her! Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.20,0:52:08.97,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,And this is ideal for peeling potatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.97,0:52:11.54,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,-Give it to me.\N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.54,0:52:13.27,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,You are not allowed, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:20.85,0:52:25.75,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,The dancing in my stomach has stopped.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.52,0:52:29.16,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,I shouldn’t be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.56,0:52:32.26,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty.\N-Court lady Choi!
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.53,0:52:35.70,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,There is no way she could have recovered so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.63,0:52:41.60,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,She is a strong woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.11,0:52:54.31,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,She smells like oil.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.31,0:52:56.48,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Why were you gone for so long?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.25,0:52:59.12,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Well, the thing is...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.15,0:53:00.29,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,My apologies.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.12,0:53:03.06,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,My hand slipped,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.32,0:53:05.49,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,and my arrow hit the queen.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.93,0:53:10.50,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Are you wounded?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.76,0:53:12.67,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,No, I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.10,0:53:15.00,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,The hunt was so tiring,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.00,0:53:17.67,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,that I fell asleep while the preparation was going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.84,0:53:18.91,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Look what.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.19,0:53:35.36,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Apron?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.16,0:53:46.93,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,When will your preparations work?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.03,0:53:48.50,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.77,0:53:51.37,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,The king put so much effort into this feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.84,0:53:54.84,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Now he should be the center of attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.53,0:54:21.00,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,All who came here as scientists must set an example
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.40,0:54:23.14,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,moderation in food,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.14,0:54:25.64,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,to show that you understand that people are starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.04,0:54:28.84,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,I will take this opportunity to announce.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.54,0:54:33.15,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Starting with this feast,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.71,0:54:35.22,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,we will reduce the number of dishes in our food.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.78,0:54:38.05,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Fewer dishes?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.95,0:54:41.02,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,What nonsense is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.12,0:54:44.19,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,When times are difficult in the country,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.19,0:54:46.83,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,the king should be part of the dishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:46.99,0:54:48.80,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,to share the pain of his people.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.16,0:54:53.43,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,By reducing the number of dishes, we feel the pain of our people,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.73,0:54:55.57,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,and we can overcome everything together.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.37,0:55:00.07,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,In times like these, select grain to please a dozen people
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.07,0:55:02.88,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,and delight your insides with a piece of meat -
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.38,0:55:04.51,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,sin.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.58,0:55:08.15,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,In the end, those who are in the palace
Dialogue: 0,0:55:08.38,0:55:11.58,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,they will serve meat on the table, they will be punished.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.22,0:55:17.76,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,I prohibit not only meat, but also any expensive food.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.22,0:55:21.53,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Ministers should not enjoy drinking, singing and dancing,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:21.96,0:55:23.83,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,and must stop the struggle of clans for power.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.73,0:55:26.27,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Those who do not accept these conditions,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.17,0:55:30.14,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,I will consider them thirsty for punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.47,0:55:33.61,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.09,0:55:49.29,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,I, Kim Jwageun, please forgive me
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.46,0:55:52.03,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,for bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.72,0:56:26.49,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,These criminals lied about their status
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.49,0:56:28.26,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,and hid in the royal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.40,0:56:31.33,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,In order to carry out your orders and serve you,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:31.33,0:56:33.13,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,they used fake identities.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.17,0:56:38.34,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,The time has come to deal with those he is hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.50,0:56:40.47,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,I’m sure he believes that the basis of his power are those
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.47,0:56:42.34,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,whom he took good care of and protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.78,0:56:45.35,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,We must exterminate this in the bud.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.28,0:56:49.25,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,So that he never rises again.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.31,0:57:15.28,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Do you have to spoil this significant day?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.28,0:57:18.01,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Do you know who they really are?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:19.41,0:57:21.58,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Some of the families guilty of high treason.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:21.58,0:57:24.18,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Others are bandits who attacked scientist-officials,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.18,0:57:26.69,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,and some are wanted for open calls against the authorities.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.02,0:57:29.92,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,They are all opponents of the royal court,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.92,0:57:31.46,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,but they, in disguise,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.46,0:57:33.93,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,guarded Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.06,0:57:36.16,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Their ultimate goal is to stage a coup.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.46,0:57:38.46,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Due to the urgency of the issue, I had no choice,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.46,0:57:40.40,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,except to immediately inform Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.24,0:57:46.31,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,This cannot be.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.31,0:57:49.51,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Someone is falsely accusing my guards,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.84,0:57:53.15,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,to weaken the defense and harm me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.65,0:57:54.88,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Who are you
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.32,0:57:58.65,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,do you mean by someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.82,0:58:02.56,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,You, troop commander Kim Jwageun.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.00,0:58:10.36,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,You behave like this,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.36,0:58:13.70,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,thinking that these three clans will support you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.63,0:58:16.94,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Do you think there are enough sweet speeches,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.94,0:58:19.17,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,to convince them to take your side?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.84,0:58:22.34,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,You are a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.91,0:58:25.08,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,It's time to wake up and realize reality.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.69,0:58:42.23,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,What insolence!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.20,0:58:47.37,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,How dare you insult the king like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.03,0:58:51.34,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,This is betrayal and treason!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.34,0:58:53.74,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,How unlike you, Your Majesty. Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.74,0:58:56.11,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,How dare you order the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:06.69,0:59:10.62,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, it seems there is something you are counting on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.79,0:59:13.19,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Whatever it is,\Nyou won't be able to use it,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.96,0:59:16.16,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,if you lose your limbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.00,0:59:21.03,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,You will have to pay for your recklessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.87,0:59:29.58,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,For your crimes you will be beheaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.31,0:59:37.45,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Your Majesty, we must follow military laws.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.12,0:59:39.49,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,They are guilty of treason, which means
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.49,0:59:41.39,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,this case is beyond the jurisdiction of the royal guard.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.39,0:59:43.32,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,The Detective Department will deal with this issue!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.86,0:59:49.86,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.23,0:59:52.83,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,The Royal Guard will take care of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.83,0:59:55.20,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,-We protest, Your Majesty!\N-We protest, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.64,0:59:59.34,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,The head of the royal guard knew who they really were!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.47,1:00:02.51,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Maybe everyone in the guard is traitors.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.51,1:00:04.81,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,The royal guards cannot be allowed to investigate what
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.81,1:00:05.91,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,what happened inside her!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.91,1:00:08.75,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,-Change your decision, Your Majesty!\N-Change your decision, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.75,1:00:11.18,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Change your decision, Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.00,1:00:24.56,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,We can disband the royal guard
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.56,1:00:27.33,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,and judge her commander.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.33,1:00:28.37,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.04,1:00:32.87,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,if you instruct me to punish the criminals,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.37,1:00:37.44,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,I will take this as a promise not to do anything else
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.61,1:00:40.65,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,and I’ll stop there.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.47,1:01:05.67,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Whatever I do,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.91,1:01:09.11,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,nothing will change.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:12.35,1:01:14.08,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,What do you wish, Your Majesty?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.66,1:01:27.73,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.67,1:01:34.13,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,I give this case
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.30,1:01:39.44,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.68,1:04:04.28,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Lord of the Earth
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.42,1:04:08.65,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,and lord of the harvest, I pray to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.22,1:04:12.26,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Bless us,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.03,1:04:16.73,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,may the crops be rich in harvest.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.60,1:04:21.10,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,May your mercy be
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.34,1:04:27.64,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,to help the people of this land\N and may they never know hunger forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.82,1:04:37.85,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Please.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.14,1:05:31.07,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,-Your Majesty!\N-Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.05,1:05:51.12,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,How I became a queen
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.91,1:06:09.48,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,The explosion damaged his hearing.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.48,1:06:10.54,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.94,1:06:13.15,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,-There won’t be any problems?\N-Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.15,1:06:14.58,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,No one is behind this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.58,1:06:16.62,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,I decided to survive,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.62,1:06:17.82,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,so don’t die.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.82,1:06:19.32,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Recover as if nothing happened,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.32,1:06:20.59,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,and I can stab you in the back.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.59,1:06:23.22,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,The internal enemy is always terrible.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.22,1:06:25.26,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Your Majesty! His Majesty...{\i}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.93,1:06:27.39,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,His Majesty...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.69,1:06:30.70,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,I suggest you stop the regency.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.70,1:06:31.76,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Your Majesty!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.76,1:06:34.87,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Everyone in this palace killed Kim So-yeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.18,0:50:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,

Comment: 0,0:53:37.22,0:53:38.78,Default,Kus5,0,0,0,,Let's set an example for the people by reducing the number of dishes.
